 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-8§1 Scope, and what other documents already hold: owner table (1): odds table and fire tick, fire registry rows, TntBlock, lava, lightning, game rules" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-OWNER" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
     MOVE SPACES TO WS-T2
     PERFORM ADD-TEXT
     MOVE "2" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "GC8-OWNER" USING WS-I1 WS-DOC
     MOVE WS-DOC TO WS-T1
