     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "acceptance US12 29b-8§1 Scope, and what other documents already hold: owner table (1): inside-block effects, entity fire ticks, client ambience, campfire block entity, campfire registry, a row" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "7" TO WS-IN
